### 3. Missing Authentication & Authorization (OWASP A01: Broken Access Control & A07: Auth Failures)

**Issue:** `/users` exposes user data (including emails — PII) with no authentication. Anyone can scrape it. The comment says "legitimate task context," but in any real app this is a serious access-control flaw.

